cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "speciesgrids: build pipeline and documentation for a gridded dataset of marine species occurrence"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Code and documentation behind speciesgrids, a cloud-optimized gridded dataset
  of WoRMS-aligned marine species distributions built from the OBIS and GBIF
  occurrence snapshots. The dataset itself is available at
  s3://obis-products/speciesgrids/h3_7/ under CC BY-NC 4.0.
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.19392660
url: https://iobis.github.io/speciesgrids/
repository-code: https://github.com/iobis/speciesgrids
license: MIT
keywords:
  - OBIS
  - GBIF
  - WoRMS
  - marine biodiversity
  - GeoParquet
  - H3
  - species distribution
authors:
